Ul(children=[Li(children=[P(children=[B(children=[Text(body=同源策略, children=[], params={})], params={}), Text(body=: 使用此方法加载的页面源（origin）为 , children=[], params={}), CodeInline(children=[Text(body=null, children=[], params={})], params={}), Text(body=，因此页面内的JavaScript无法访问 通过'http(s)'等其他协议加载的内容。要设置一个可信的源，请使用 , children=[], params={}), DocumentationLink(dri=com.m8test.script.core.api.ui.webview/Controller/loadDataWithBaseURL/#com.m8test.script.core.api.coroutines.CoroutineScope#kotlin.String?#kotlin.String#kotlin.String?#kotlin.String?#kotlin.String?/PointingToDeclaration/, children=[Text(body=loadDataWithBaseURL, children=[], params={})], params={href=[loadDataWithBaseURL]}), Text(body=。, children=[], params={})], params={})], params={}), Li(children=[P(children=[B(children=[Text(body=字符编码, children=[], params={})], params={}), Text(body=: 'data' URL默认使用US-ASCII字符集。如果需要指定其他字符集， 建议您自行构建完整的 'data' URL 并通过 , children=[], params={}), DocumentationLink(dri=com.m8test.script.core.api.ui.webview/Controller/navigateTo/#com.m8test.script.core.api.coroutines.CoroutineScope#kotlin.String/PointingToDeclaration/, children=[Text(body=navigateTo, children=[], params={})], params={href=[navigateTo]}), Text(body= 加载。, children=[], params={})], params={})], params={})], params={})

@param scope 用于执行此操作的协程作用域。
